m. Goodnight everyone.","media":null,"username":"tiptransformed","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":4,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":4.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266475730113724416","date":1590786318000,"rawContent":"CW: EXTREMELY disturbing imagery of police violence. \n\nThis song was released in 1982. And it\u2019s more relevant than ever. ACAB! #BlackLivesMatter \n\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/Z0I5KlBXvV via @YouTube","media":null,"username":"tiptransformed","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":5,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":5.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266503454949699584","date":1590792928000,"rawContent":"As do I. #BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"tiptransformed","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":6,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":6.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266590201540796417","date":1590813610000,"rawContent":"What I do know is that I stand with the protesters and that #BlackLivesMatter, damnit. And I agree that without justice for ALL, there\u2019s no real justice for anyone. No justice, no peace. In the streets or in my soul. \n\nPlease stay as safe as you can, everyone.","media":null,"username":"tiptransformed","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":fa