e":0.0},{"id":"1266902925965578242","date":1590888170000,"rawContent":"To friends and loved ones in Seattle: this is making the WTO look like nothing. Please, be as safe as you can and find shelter where and when you can. \n\nAnd I may still be on the sidelines, but I support you 100%. #BlackLivesMatter and #SPDSucks","media":null,"username":"tiptransformed","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":11,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":11.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266956911955423233","date":1590901041000,"rawContent":"As a Jew, this is a passage that strikes me straight in the heart. I weep with Rachel, for all the victims of injustice. When there is no justice for some, there is no freedom for all. #BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"tiptransformed","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":12,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":12.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266963496144482304","date":1590902611000,"rawContent":"And modern policing is neither an immutable necessity nor an inevitability. We can do better. And we should strive for a better, more fair, more just system. For everyone, or else it\u2019s for no one. #BlackLivesMatter 4\/4","media":null,"username":"tiptransformed","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":13,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":13.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1266968942850924545","date":1590903909000,"rawContent":"Ok, it\u2019s time for me to get off Twitter for the night. Everyone try to stay safe, and remember #ACAB No one truly has justice until everyone has justice, and #BlackLivesMatter! Goodnight!","media":null,"username":"tiptransformed","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":14,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":14.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1267331113527046146","date":1590990257000,"rawContent":"Ok, I should really get off Twitter. It\u2019s privilege that I can shut this app down and try to sleep without being subjected to the fascist evil going on across the country tonight, and I absolutely recognize that. #ACAB #BlackLivesMatter Stay sage if you can, and goodnight. \ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc9a","media":null,"username":"tiptransformed","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":15,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":15.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1267685878555533313","date":1591074840000,"rawContent":"Ok, I think it\u2019s probably time to get off Twitter for today. As always, please try to stay as safe as you can, and #BlackLivesMatter! Goodnight everyone.","media":null,"username":"tiptransformed","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":16,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":16.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"roll